v0.089: fix DPD exporter/importer/collection address nesting, add full sender address fields, collapsible Settings

- DPD's party blocks (collectionDetails, deliveryDetails, exporterDetails,
  importerDetails) all nest address/contactDetails objects; we were sending
  exporter, importer and collection fields flat. That is what produced
  "Exporter address is mandatory" despite Settings being fully populated,
  and meant the collection address was silently ignored in favour of the
  DPD account default. Rebuilt against DPD's published schema.
- Phone numbers stripped to digits (keeping a leading +) and trimmed to 15
  chars, matching DPD's telephone pattern - spaces/brackets were liable to
  get a whole shipment rejected.
- Settings > DPD gains address lines 2 and 4 (locality/county) and a sender
  VAT number; the sender email field is removed as DPD has no such field.
- Settings page: collapsible sections, full page width, floating Save.

